- Nondegeneracy gives (1/X)Σ_{m∈[sX,tX]} e^{imθ_j} → 0 for θ ≠ 0, so the full-integer measures tend to Leb × Haar.
  Hence ν = g dt dω with 0 <= g <= 1.
