+
+| Polynomial | Exact interval | Bernstein proof | Independent Sturm roots |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| beta'(x) | [-1/1000,1] | 2 leaves | 0, positive endpoints |
+| A(x)/x | [0,61804/100000] | 1 leaf | 0, positive endpoints |
